            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "na ũndũ ũũ naw’o nĩ ngelekan’yo ya ĩvinda yĩĩ twĩ nayo; na kwĩanana nayo mĩthĩnzĩo na nthembo sya kũtonywa nithembawa ila itatonya kũmwĩanĩsya ũsu ũthaithaa ũndũ wa wasya wa ngoo, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.9.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.9.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
