        },
        {
          "text": "Nũndũ ethĩwa nthakame ya mbũi na nzaũ, na kwĩtĩkya mũu wa moi ĩũlũ wa ala mavukĩtw’e, nitheasya kũvika kũthesya mwĩĩ: ",
