                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na kwondũ wa ũu nĩ mwĩw’anĩthya wa ũtianĩo mweũ, kana kĩkw’ũ kyamina kwĩthĩwa kw’o ũndũ wa wovosyo wa mavĩtyo ala meekĩtwe ĩvinda ya ũtianĩo wa mbee, ala meetiwe mose ũla watho wa ũtiĩwa wa tene na tene. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.9.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.9.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 9:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nũndũ vala ve ũtianĩo, mũvaka vethĩwe kĩkw’ũ kya ũla watianĩa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.9.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.9.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 9:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nũndũ ũtianĩo wĩ na vinya vala ve kĩkw’ũ: nũndũ ndwĩ na vinya o na ĩndĩĩ yĩla ũla watianĩa wĩ thayũ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.9.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.9.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 9:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwondũ wa ũu o na ũtianĩo wa mbee ndwaambĩlĩlw’a vate nthakame. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.9.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.9.18"
            ]
          }
        },
